      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given that now an error is emitted when the `java_api_contribution` module does not follow `\".api.contribution\"`-suffix naming convention, I have set this to default to false to prevent modifications in all test cases where the `java_api_contribution` modules do not follow this naming convention. Since the modules that require validation are generated from `java_sdk_library` with `enable_validation` set to `true`, I do not believe that this would cause any issues.",
      "parentUuid": "b493732f_56fe218f",
