      "writtenOn": "2023-10-11T14:29:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s still not clear to me that this needs to be added for all `apiContributions`\n\nIt seems like these should only be added for the `droidstubs` module that is used in the `static_libs`/`exclude_static_libs` cases, otherwise, we\u0027re likely overtriggering the validation.\n\ne.g. prior to building from .txt files, if the sources change such that public API changes, today that would be id-ed by building the public API droidstubs, not public + system.\n\nhistorically, you\u0027d fail the checkapi validation when building the public stubs, not the system -- in fact the system module won\u0027t run the validation for public stubs unless it depends on it.\n\nI won\u0027t block on this, but its worth thinking through what\u0027s actually needed here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1836,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 1836,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "efd76e525bc194f2a97ce9240b4bca9175dc4d99",
